#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_learning_artifact__dominant_indicator_ids
msgid ""
"The character indicators that appear in this artifact and belong to a "
"dominant character tag. It is a mark of the activity, not evidence of the "
"character achievement of a student."
msgstr ""
"Indikator karakter yang muncul pada artefak ini dan termasuk dalam tag "
"karakter dominan. Ini adalah penanda aktivitas, bukan bukti pencapaian "
"karakter siswa."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_learning_artifact__secondary_indicator_ids
msgid ""
"The character indicators that appear in this artifact and belong to a "
"secondary character tag. It is a mark of the activity, not evidence of the "
"character achievement of a student."
msgstr ""
"Indikator karakter yang muncul pada artefak ini dan termasuk dalam tag "
"karakter sekunder. Ini adalah penanda aktivitas, bukan bukti pencapaian "
"karakter siswa."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_learning_artifact__dominant_subconstruct_ids
