"The character sub-constructs that dominate this artifact. It is a tag of the "
"activity, not evidence of the character achievement of a student. There is "
"no limit on the number of tags."
msgstr ""
"Subkonstruk karakter yang mendominasi artefak ini. Ini adalah tag aktivitas, "
"bukan bukti pencapaian karakter siswa. Jumlah tag tidak dibatasi."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact_character
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact_character.field_school_character_indicator_grade_status__grade_type_id
